#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:70 01ad2e2431694cb9b3146f4d95dc709e
msgid ""
"Search arXiv for papers by keyword using the public arXiv API. Returns "
"papers with title, abstrac..."
msgstr "使用公共 arXiv API 根据关键词搜索 arXiv 论文。返回包含标题、摘要的论文信息..."

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst aa9be2be031341048f0ece0b84d23e69
msgid "ArXiv_search_papers tool specification"
msgstr "ArXiv_search_papers 工具规格说明"

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:76 a25f54dfd399475a8a7689c01bc477ac
msgid "**Name**: ``ArXiv_search_papers``"
msgstr "**名称**：``ArXiv_search_papers``"

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:77 cfbc2e76697d4238bad2e6fbf6c93977
msgid "**Type**: ``ArXivTool``"
msgstr "**类型**：``ArXivTool``"

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:78 884ec9efb588489e9ed8ea53579a0901
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search arXiv for papers by keyword using the public "
"arXiv API. Returns papers with title, abstract, authors, publication "
"date, category, and URL."
msgstr "**描述**：使用公共 arXiv API 根据关键词搜索 arXiv 论文。返回包含标题、摘要、作者、发布日期、分类及链接的论文信息。"

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:82 c2cfc9a520b6416bac759e41285bc181
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for arXiv papers. Use keywords"
" separated by spaces to refine your search."
msgstr "``query``（字符串）（必填）用于搜索arXiv论文的查询词。使用空格分隔的关键词以细化搜索结果。"

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:85 38eabec7ca7f412e92a954e7f246ad8f
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Number of papers to return. This sets the "
"maximum number of papers retrieved from arXiv."
msgstr "``limit``（整数）（可选）返回的论文数量。此参数设置从arXiv检索的论文最大数量。"

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:88 7f60308a031d4892a17937e367eefc49
msgid ""
"``sort_by`` (string) (optional) Sort order for results. Options: "
"'relevance', 'lastUpdatedDate', 'submittedDate'"
msgstr "``sort_by``（字符串）（可选）结果的排序方式。选项包括：'relevance'（相关性）、'lastUpdatedDate'（最后更新日期）、'submittedDate'（提交日期）"

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:91 abfd54f4204b4ceb90b7bb716421bc43
msgid ""
"``sort_order`` (string) (optional) Sort direction. Options: 'ascending', "
"'descending'"
msgstr "``sort_order``（字符串）（可选）排序方向。选项：‘ascending’、‘descending’"

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:94 460c5b0190744f0eb3695c9d3d3085c4
msgid ""
"``date_from`` (string) (optional) Filter results from this date (format: "
"YYYY-MM-DD). Uses submittedDate range."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/arxiv_tools.rst:97 df8017fcfe5b4ebc81635682299c4083
msgid ""
"``date_to`` (string) (optional) Filter results up to this date (format: "
"YYYY-MM-DD). Uses submittedDate range."
msgstr ""

